90","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix Patch 4.0.2","summary":"Hotfix Patch 4.0.2Added new vault-over animations.Fixed a bug where telekinesis-pulled items would duplicate themselves.Fixed a bug where telekinesis-pulled items would get stuck in the player's hand.Improved inventory pick-up when a stack is full.Fixed a bug where the weapon would disappear when toggling the Barrier ability.Overhauled stair animations.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:05:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032369","verified_at":"2026-10-22T14:00:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1846651706693998","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix Patch 4.0.1","summary":"Hotfix Patch 4.0.1Fixed an issue where enemy AI movement was affected by higher FPS.Fixed bench material.Fixed paused cutscene UI animation.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T07:13:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693998","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1846651706691584","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"announcement","title":"PSYCHO DEAD is taking part in the October Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hi everyone! We're participating in the Steam Next Fest October event with our new demo update 4.0!In this update, we've added several new features and improved many aspects of the game's quality. New Features 1. Closet System We've introduced a closet in the save room where players can change and buy costumes for Elixia. To purchase new costumes, players must search for tokens hidden around the map to use as currency. Once purchased, all costumes will be shared across all save files, including ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:07:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691584","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1846018067928250","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"announcement","title":"NEW TRAILER AND 50K WISHLISTS CELEBRATION","summary":"Hello everyone, Sorry for the long silence! We've been heads down working on our project, and we have a lot of exciting news to share this month. First of all, we're thrilled to announce that PSYCHO DEAD has reached a massive milestone: 50,000 wishlists on Steam! We couldn't have made it this far without every single one of you. Thank you so much for your incredible support! Secondly, we just debuted a brand-new trailer featured in the HARVEST OF TERROR: The Horror Game Awards Showcase. It's pac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T03:55:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928250","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1836506165573711","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"update","title":"40K WISHLISTS CELEBRATION & DEMO PATCH 3.0 IS LIVE!","summary":"We are absolutely thrilled to announce that PSYCHO DEAD has reached 40,000 wishlists on Steam! 🎉This milestone is beyond anything we imagined when we first started this project with core team of fewer than five people. From the bottom of our hearts, thank you. Your support, feedback, and enthusiasm have carried us through every challenge — and this achievement belongs to you as much as it does to us.Looking back at our early development, it's incredible to see how far PSYCHO DEAD has come. We've","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-05T09:34:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165573711","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1833968530898435","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"update","title":"Release Window, New Trailer, Key Art, and Development Update!","summary":"Hi everyone, We are super excited to share our brand-new trailer, which was recently featured in the Midsummer Night's Scream horror showcase! Check it out below! Our latest trailer gives you a sneak peek at brand-new levels, showcases Elixia’s new outfit (which you might recognize from our previous concept art), and drops a major announcement: our official release window! We are officially targeting Winter 2026.We know you're eager to dive into the full game, and we ask for just a little more o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T18:17:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530898435","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1828441623104694","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"announcement","title":"30,000 Wishlists & Main Outfit Concept","summary":"A huge thank you to every fan and supporter! We are glad to reveal that PSYCHO DEAD has reached another milestone: 30,000 wishlists on Steam!To celebrate, we are proud to reveal the new concept art for the main outfit. We’ve listened to your feedback that the previous outfit may not have suited everyone’s preferences, so here is the concept art for the new look! Don’t worry if you preferred the original—you can still switch back to the old outfit or the patient gown via the wardrobe. As for othe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-27T14:30:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623104694","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1827626365759748","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"update","title":"PSYCHO DEAD demo patch 2.0 is out now!","summary":"Hello everyone, As we previously mentioned regarding our demo upgrade process, we are excited to bring you the second major patch for the PSYCHO DEAD demo. Since our last update, we have been carefully reading all of your feedback and incorporating as many improvements as possible while simultaneously developing the full game. !!! Important Note for players of previous versions: We highly recommend deleting your old save files. You can find them at: Users/Admin/AppData/Local Please delete the fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-21T10:32:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365759748","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1826362059931044","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"update","title":"New Combat Trailer & Development Update!","summary":"Hi everyone, We are thrilled to share our brand-new Combat Trailer, which was recently featured in The MIX & Kinda Funny Spring Game Showcase!Releasing two trailers in such a short window has been a significant challenge for our team, but we’ve been pouring our hearts into development to ensure we deliver the best possible experience for you.We know you want to get your hands on these improvements! We are currently in the process of upgrading the playable demo to match the high-quality visuals a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-09T17:52:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059931044","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1825727806721136","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"announcement","title":"New Gameplay Trailer From Best Indie Games Spring Showcase 2026!","summary":"Hi everyone, We are proud to share that our brand-new trailer was featured in the Best Indie Games Spring Showcase 2026! Clemmy's Best Indie Games Spring Showcase is the BIGgest indie games showcase of the Spring! Watch the TrailerThis trailer showcases new areas, deadlier monsters, and visual improvements that go far beyond what you saw in the initial demo. We’ve worked hard on this, and we hope it meets—and exceeds—your expectations!In the coming weeks, we will be releasing a major update to o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-03T18:05:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806721136","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1815034432879074","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"announcement","title":"20,000 WISHLISTS & HAPPY HALLOWEEN! 🎃","summary":"A massive thank you to everyone in our community! Since the demo's release, your incredible support and valuable feedback have propelled PSYCHO DEAD past a huge milestone: 20,000 wishlists on steam! From the very beginning, our small team has poured everything we have into bringing this vision to life. Your support, feedback, and encouragement have kept us going through every challenge — and this milestone belongs to you as much as it does to us. Thank you to everyone who has played the demo, sh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-30T18:37:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815034432879074","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1814309641574628","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"update","title":"First Major Demo Update!","summary":"Hello everyone,We're excited to bring you the first major patch for the PSYCHODEAD demo! Since the release, we've been reading all your incredible feedback—thank you so much for every comment and suggestion you've sent our way.A quick note : while this patch tackles a lot of your reports, it doesn't fix everything just yet. We still have a list of things to improve, but this is a big first step for us. Our main goal is always to make the full game the best experience it can be for you.Below are ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-27T16:24:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1814309641574628","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1811772772612988","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"announcement","title":"Thai Indie Studio Behind PSYCHO DEAD Exclusive Interview.","summary":"MOON CATALYST – Thai Indie Studio Behind PSYCHO DEAD Talks with Online Station We at MOON CATALYST had the opportunity for an exclusive interview with Online Station, one of Thailand’s largest digital gaming media. In this feature, we discussed PSYCHO DEAD — a Thai-made survival horror game — covering topics such as the game’s core concepts, inspirations, development process, expectations and more. Without further delay, let’s dive into the full interview. Q: How many people are currently on the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-06T17:45:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772612988","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1811772772418034","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"announcement","title":"PSYCHO DEAD Demo Out Now!","summary":"PSYCHO DEAD Demo Out Now! - Experience the First Hour of TerrorThe PSYCHO DEAD demo is now live on Steam! Face the nightmare and experience the first 45–60 minutes of our survival horror journey.In the demo, you’ll play as Elixia, a girl with psychic powers who awakens with no memory of her past. Can you help her survive and uncover the truth behind what happened?We’ve also released both the Demo Announcement Trailer and the Gameplay Reveal Trailer during the Horror Game Awards: Halloween Showca","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-30T19:05:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772418034","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1811138915491029","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"announcement","title":"PSYCHO DEAD Big Reveal and Our Thanks to You!","summary":"Hi everyone, First of all, thank you for following and supporting us throughout this journey. It has been two and a half years since we began developing PSYCHO DEAD—a project born from our small team’s love, passion, and determination for the survival horror genre. Every step has been a challenge, but also a step closer to realizing our dream. Now, we’re thrilled to share that the wait is almost over. PSYCHO DEAD will have its major reveal during the Horror Game Awards: Halloween Showcase, and w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-21T14:02:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811138915491029","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1803527891690786","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"announcement","title":"10,000 WISHLISTS ACHIEVED!","summary":"This is a HUGE milestone for our small team, and we’re overwhelmed by your support. Thank you all so much—it truly means the world to us! More exciting news coming soon… stay tuned! 🔥","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-02T03:26:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1803527891690786","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1802354289678228","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"announcement","title":"PSYCHO DEAD is part of ‘Games to Get Excited About Fest 2025’!","summary":"Thrilled to share that PSYCHO DEAD is featured in Alpha Beta Gamer’s ‘Games to Get Excited About Fest 2025’! It's a showcase designed to respect viewer's time, with 110 indie games showcased in just over an hour. No filler, no cinematic trailers and no paid placements - all games are in the showcase under their own merit. Massive thanks to Alpha Beta Gamer for the inclusion! Games to Get Excited About Fest - Trailer Check out our Steam Festival page:https://store.steampowered.com/curator/5005663","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-16T03:44:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1802354289678228","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018390-1800991756403345","game_id":"steam-3018390","kind":"announcement","title":"PSYCHO DEAD’s first gameplay teaser trailer","summary":"We just revealed the first gameplay trailer for PSYCHODEAD at The Horror Game Award Summer Showcase 2025! More updates coming soon… stay tuned. If you interested and want to support us, Don't forget to Wishlist : https://store.steampowered.com/app/3018390/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-01T09:26:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https:/